The '''Enarc Run''' was a [[hyperspace route]]. The [[planet]] [[Naboo]], which was located in the [[Mid Rim Territories|Mid Rim's]] [[Chommell sector]], was one of the worlds along the route.<ref name="Rise of the Separatists" /> The route ran from the [[Vondarc system]] on the [[Rimma Trade Route]] to [[Enarc]], at a junction with the [[Triellus Trade Route]].<ref name="TFA" />

==Behind the scenes==
The Enarc Run was first mentioned in the new ''[[Star Wars]]'' [[canon]] on a map featured in the [[2016]] [[StarWars.com]] article [[Where in the Galaxy Are the Worlds of Star Wars: The Force Awakens?|Where in the Galaxy Are the Worlds of ''Star Wars: The Force Awakens''?]].<ref name="TFA Where in the Galaxy">{{SW|url=news/where-in-the-galaxy-are-the-worlds-of-star-wars-the-force-awakens|text=Where in the Galaxy Are the Worlds of ''Star Wars: The Force Awakens''?|int=Where in the Galaxy Are the Worlds of Star Wars: The Force Awakens?}}</ref> It was originally created for the [[Star Wars Legends|''Star Wars'' Legends]] continuity, where it was first mentioned in [[Twin Stars of Kira (sourcebook)|''Twin Stars of Kira'']], a [[1993]] supplement produced for ''[[Star Wars: The Roleplaying Game]]'' by [[West End Games]].<ref name="TSoK">[[Twin Stars of Kira (sourcebook)|''Twin Stars of Kira'']]</ref>

